window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Sean and his women are about to embark on an adventure to the frozen wasteland of Astarapholes’s demonic realm. It won’t be easy, but it’s their only chance to save Daisy’s sister and the other students from Colmar Magical Academy.</p> <p>In the heart of the icy realm, they’ll uncover ancient secrets about the magical history of Waycross, gain new abilities, and face trials that will test their strength—and their bonds—like never before.</p> <p>Of course, there will be some time for rest and relaxation as well. The property in Waycross needs some work, and Sean is planning a date night with Anais to show her how things are done in Waycross.</p>"; 
